{"sections":[{"slug":"形式取逆","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"形式取逆"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">形式取逆</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“形式取逆”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">环的局部化</span></h3>\n<p>$A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为交换环</span>, $f\\in A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为任意元素</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nA_f = \\operatorname{colim}(A\\overset{f}{\\to}A\\overset{f}{\\to}\\cdots).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它是从</span> $A$ “<span lang=\"zh\">形式上取</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的逆</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">得到的环</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">范畴的稳定化</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可表现带基点范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathrm {Pr}^{\\mathrm L}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的余极限</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Stab}\\mathcal C =\\operatorname{colim}(\\mathcal C\\overset{\\Sigma}{\\to}\\mathcal C\\overset{\\Sigma}{\\to}\\cdots),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即形式上令</span> $\\Sigma$ <span lang=\"zh\">可逆得到的范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">为了计算该余极限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">注意到它等价于</span> $\\mathrm {Pr}^{\\mathrm R}\\simeq (\\mathrm {Pr}^{\\mathrm L})^{\\mathrm {op}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的极限</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{lim}(\\cdots\\overset{\\Omega}{\\to}\\mathcal C\\overset{\\Omega}{\\to}\\mathcal C).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}